<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea</p>
<p>Auction of 6,712 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 4,512</p>
<p>offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last</p>
<p>sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  135   (138 and 125)</p>
<p>    Good		unq   (unq and 111)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     130   (128 and 104)</p>
<p>    Medium	    123   (123 and  95)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 99   ( 85 and  80 nom)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 135 pence for a landed Rwanda PF1</p>
<p>and 137 pence for an offshore Kenya PF1.</p>
</text>
